  "title": {
   "en": "Oyasumi Fumi-san"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "おやすみ ふみさん"
   },
   {
    "en": "Good night Fumi-san"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Rinta, who moved to the city from the countryside and enrolled in a university in the heart of the city, meets \"Fumi-san,\" rumored to be the most beautiful girl on campus, in the literature club he joined. After attending a drinking party together, he ends up walking her home. He safely escorts her to her house and is about to head back when suddenly... Fumi-san transforms and forcefully invites him to her bed—!? \"I wonder how long you can keep being a good person, Rinta-kun...?\" Fumi-san pushes Rinta to his limits, testing his self-control until it shatters.",
   "ja": "春。田舎から上京し、都心の大学に入学した凛太は、入部した文芸部で学園一の美女と噂される\"ふみさん\"に出会う。そして、共に参加した飲み会帰りに彼女を送ることになったのだが…。無事家まで送り届け、ひとり帰ろうとしたその矢先！ 豹変したふみさんに強引にベッドに誘われてーー！？「凛太くんが良い人でいられるのは、いつまでかな…？」ふみさんに理性崩壊まで試される。"
  },
